 NOTE FOR THE MAINTAINER:

 This header is the short GPL notice. GitHub will not detect the license as
 GPL-3.0 from the header alone — it needs the FULL license text in this file.

 Before publishing, replace everything below this line with the canonical
 GPL-3.0 text, which must be included verbatim and not paraphrased:

     curl -o LICENSE https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

 then re-add your copyright line at the top if you wish. The full text is
 ~35 KB and is intentionally not reproduced from memory here, because an
 inaccurate license file has legal consequences — it must be the exact,
 official FSF text.
